fixture bell_seed_1
doc docs/adr/0015, determinism: a run is a seed and its inputs. Five Bells (50%) over six Taper hits (three side 1, side 2 pairs, the chain let go between them, with a short walk to stay in reach): one PROCS draw a hit, in order. Seed 1's draws ring on the first and the sixth hit; seed 2's (bell_seed_2) on the second and the sixth.
seed 1
room test/tough_dummy
option votive_bell_of_the_vigil 5
frames 120
input
  0 attack
  7 attack
  30..32 R
  50 attack
  57 attack
  70..72 R
  100 attack
  107 attack
end
expect
  at 2 event.hit=1 procs=1
  at 9 event.hit=1 procs=0
  at 52 event.hit=1 procs=0
  at 59 event.hit=1 procs=0
  at 102 event.hit=1 procs=0
  at 109 event.hit=1 procs=1
end
